            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>JUST UPDATED!</h1><p>The<strong> CURSE OF THE NETHER-GHOUL</strong> is available now!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523720/extras/f08f1f38e10a9c6932454461f7d84c5a.avif?t=1485789198\" width=600 height=384 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523720/extras/eca88cd7b8dbdb94d74d7f1316617a24.avif?t=1485789198\" width=600 height=384 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523720/extras/c9cad650af90620b453fa82b7eea7ef5.avif?t=1485789198\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Unruly Ghouls is an insanely fun VR arcade style defense shooter set in a beautifully spooky environment. The ghouls may look cute but they must be stopped! The only thing keeping them from taking over are your super high tech anti-ghoul wards, which these ghouls will stop at nothing to destroy. Grab your ghoul hunting inventions and take these ghouls out! Experience what it feels like to be <i>inside </i>an arcade game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Shooter Defense Gameplay - A new take on defense gameplay blended with arcade shooting action!<br></li><li>Anti-Ghoul Inventions - Weaken the ghouls with your blaster and suck them up using your vacuum! This combination is a new gameplay experience you can't get anywhere else!<br></li><li>Local Leaderboard - Compete with your friends for the high score, the top ten scores and intitials are saved, the perfect VR party game!<br></li><li>Spectral Orbs - Collect spectral orbs to power up your inventions or repair your anti-ghoul wards!<br></li><li>Multiple Ghoul Enemies - From minion ghouls to a huge boss ghoul, there are several variations of the ghouls to fight!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Unruly Ghouls is an insanely fun VR arcade style defense shooter set in a beautifully spooky environment. The ghouls may look cute but they must be stopped! The only thing keeping them from taking over are your super high tech anti-ghoul wards, which these ghouls will stop at nothing to destroy. Grab your ghoul hunting inventions and take these ghouls out! Experience what it feels like to be <i>inside </i>an arcade game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Shooter Defense Gameplay - A new take on defense gameplay blended with arcade shooting action!<br></li><li>Anti-Ghoul Inventions - Weaken the ghouls with your blaster and suck them up using your vacuum! This combination is a new gameplay experience you can't get anywhere else!<br></li><li>Local Leaderboard - Compete with your friends for the high score, the top ten scores and intitials are saved, the perfect VR party game!<br></li><li>Spectral Orbs - Collect spectral orbs to power up your inventions or repair your anti-ghoul wards!<br></li><li>Multiple Ghoul Enemies - From minion ghouls to a huge boss ghoul, there are several variations of the ghouls to fight!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Do you hate ghouls? Would you like to obliterate ghouls using your anti-ghoul inventions? Unruly Ghouls is a fun arcade style defense shooter set in a beautifully spooky environment. Experience what it feels like to be inside an arcade game.",
